  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">handicaptraining apatity</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">handikappomsorg apatity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ryssland; St&#xf6;d till handikappomsorg i Apatity/Murmansk. Syftet &#xe4;r kunskapsutbyte f&#xf6;r en mer positiv och respektfull inst&#xe4;llning till handikappade barn inom relevanta institutioner. Studiebes&#xf6;ksutbyte mellan Boden och Apatity inkluderar politiker, repr. fr&#xe5;n enskilda org.och socialarbetare som arbetar direkt med handikappade barn.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at a transfer of knowhow and a more positive and respectful attitude towards handicapped children within relevant institutions. Exchange of visits between the cities of Boden and Apatity will include politicians, representatives of NGOs as well as social workers directly involved in work with handicapped children.</narrative>
  </description>
